'''Blooming Kamukura''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the Rare Cat Capsule during the [[Easter Carnival (Gacha Event)|Easter Carnival]] event. It was added in [[Version 10.3 Update|Version 10.3]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 11.4 Update|Version 11.4]] grants target [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 595
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Blooming Kamukura
|name2 = Everbloom Kamukura
|name3 = Everbloom Lord Kamukura
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Everbloom Kamukura''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Everbloom Lord Kamukura''' at level 30 using [[Catfruit]] and XP.

==Strategy/Usage==
Blooming Kamukura can be used either as a ranged damage dealer, thanks to his range and damage, or to crowd-control Metal enemies. His slow and knockback ability can deal with Metal enemies very well because most of them have very low range, overall this unit is only average across the board.

==='''True Form'''===
Everbloom Lord Kamukura now targets [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] enemies for a 50% chance to slow them or knock them back. This ability can be useful against some Aku enemies, though the lack of [[Shield Piercing]] limits his usage against [[Shield]]ed Aku enemies. His immunity to waves also helps somewhat against [[Wicked Face]], [[Possessed Empress]], and [[Deathkory]], as they all attack with either regular waves or mini-waves. However, all of them are protected by Shields, thus meaning that Everbloom Lord Kamukura's compatability against them requires a different Cat to pierce them.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Backliner}}

